  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks. Cut carrot into small chunks. Thickly slice zucchini into half-moons. Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-12c8dcc6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice onion. Finely chop garlic.\n• Use your hands to break each spinach falafel into quarters (don't worry if they crumble!). Roughly chop leaves from herbs. In a small bowl, combine creamy pesto dressing and Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-f4ee0e54.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes. Transfer to a second small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-1f52233c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, combine the water and vegetable stock powder in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil. Add couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork. Stir through the roasted veggies and mixed leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-32f3aad7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While couscous is cooking, wash out frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with some olive oil (1/4 cup for 2 people/ 1/2 cup for 4 people).\n• When oil is hot, cook falafel, tossing, until deep golden brown, 5-6 minutes. Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-f5b266e0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide roast veggie couscous between plates. Top with falafel and some caramelised onion. Drizzle with pesto yoghurt. Garnish with flaked almonds and herbs to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6231779f14d8da685214c256/step-6fa9f624.jpg"
    }
  ]
